>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>円滑<rp>(</rp><rt>えんかつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>進<rp>(</rp><rt>すす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>める。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">使会议顺利进行。</span><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n1/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">滑</a></span></div><span class=\"st\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">縁側</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えんがわ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">缘侧；日式传统建筑外侧的外廊；鱼鳍基部的骨头（尤指比目鱼）；鱼鳍基部的肉</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">沿岸</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えんがん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">海岸；岸边；沿岸水域；近海水域；沿岸地区</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"199625\">トロール<ruby>漁船<rp>(</rp><rt>ぎょせん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>沿岸<rp>(</rp><rt>えんがん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>魚<rp>(</rp><rt>さかな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をとりつくしました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">特洛尔渔船在沿海捕鱼。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">婉曲</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えんきょく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">婉转；迂回；间接；拐弯抹角</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">演習</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えんしゅう</spa