by>学生<rp>(</rp><rt>がくせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちは「ハムレット」を<ruby>演<rp>(</rp><rt>えん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">学生们表演哈姆雷特。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/9963172\" title=\"Tatoeba · GlossaMatik\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · GlossaMatik\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">演ずる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えんずる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"v-m\">扮演（角色）；饰演；演出（戏剧等）；上演；犯（失误）；装作；出丑</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"110309\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はロミオを<ruby>演<rp>(</rp><rt>えん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ずるとプログラムに<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>で</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">当他扮演罗米奥时,他出现在节目中。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">沿線</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えんせん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">沿线；铁路沿线；公路沿线</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">縁談</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えんだん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">婚事；婚谈；提亲</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">遠方</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えんぽう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">远方；远处；遥远的地方</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"188650\"><ruby>遠方<rp>(</rp><rt>えんぽう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>城<rp>(</rp><rt>しろ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>見<rp>(</rp><rt>み</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">远处看到了城堡。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">円満</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">えんまん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">和睦；圆满；友好；顺利；平安无事</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"186906\"><ruby>家庭<rp>(</rp><rt>かてい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>円満<rp>(</rp><rt>えんまん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">家是平静的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">尾</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">お</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">动物的尾巴；尾部；风筝等的尾部；末端；彗星的尾部；山脚处的斜坡</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"79151\"><ruby>雄<rp>(</rp><rt>おす</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のくじゃくは<ruby>尾<rp>(</rp><rt>お</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>羽毛<rp>(</rp><rt>うもう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>色彩<rp>(</rp><rt>しきさい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>豊<rp>(</rp><rt>ゆた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かである。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">男子的尾部的翅膀是彩色的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">甥</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">侄子；外甥</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"188563\"><ruby>甥<rp>(</rp><rt>おい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>とは<ruby>兄弟<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>か<ruby>姉妹<rp>(</rp><rt>しまい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>息子<rp>(</rp><rt>むすこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のことです。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">孙子是兄弟姐妹的儿子。</span></div></li>"]